@startuml GitEasyDataFlow
title GitEasy - Data Flow (v1.5.5)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

component "Public commands" <<command>> as Cmd
component "Invoke-GEGit\n+ git executable" <<engine>> as Engine
component "Log session helpers\nStart / Add / Complete" <<helper>> as LogH
component "Credential-surface sanitisers\nFormat-GESafeUrl, Format-GESafeLogLine" <<helper>> as Sanitise
component "Get-GELogPath" <<helper>> as LogPath
component "Remove-GEOldLog" <<helper>> as Prune
component "Show-Diagnostic" <<command>> as Diag

component ".git repository" <<store>> as Repo
component "Network remote" <<boundary>> as Remote
component "Diagnostic log files" <<store>> as Logs
component "Env: GITEASY_LOG_PATH\n/ LOCALAPPDATA" <<store>> as Env
component "Temp commit-message file" <<store>> as Tmp
component ".psd1 manifest" <<store>> as Psd
component "Credential stores" <<store>> as Creds

Cmd --> Engine : all git work
Engine --> Repo : read / write
Engine --> Remote : push = write, fetch = read
Cmd --> LogH : mutating + config commands
Cmd --> Sanitise : credential-surface commands\n(Reset-Login, Test-Login,\nShow-Remote via QHelp)
Engine --> Sanitise : F-06: arg URLs before log + throw
Sanitise --> LogH : sanitised lines into log session
LogH --> Logs : write / append
LogH --> LogPath
LogPath --> Env : read resolution order
LogH --> Prune
Prune --> Logs : delete older than 30 days
Diag --> LogPath
Diag --> Logs : read / open
Cmd --> Tmp : Save-Work writes then deletes
Cmd --> Psd : Save-Work -BumpVersion read / write
Cmd --> Creds : Set-Token / Set-Ssh / Set-Vault write;\nTest-Login / Get-VaultStatus read

note bottom of Logs
  One self-contained file per invocation.
  Header + per-git-step records + outcome.
  All URL-shaped content sanitised through
  the Credential-surface sanitisers above
  (F-01/F-03/F-05/F-06 hardening).
end note
@enduml
